{"4959840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keep On Punching", "steam_appid": 4959840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Keep Punching<br><br>Step into a cozy underground gym and do the one thing that matters Keep On Punching. Every hit fills your pockets, every upgrade lands harder, and the bag never stops swinging. It's the satisfying, one more punch idle brawler that's easy to pick up and impossible to put down. </strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Punch, earn, upgrade. Land hits, stack up coins, and pour them into Attack Power, Speed, Economy, Critical Chance, Stamina and more.<br><br>Unlock knockout techniques. Work your way up from a simple jab to hooks, a mighty Big Punch, and flashy multi-hit combos.<br><br>Crits, Perfects &amp; combos. Trigger critical strikes and Perfect Punches, then chain juicy combos for massive payouts.<br><br>Manage your stamina. Punch smart, not just hard, balance raw power against endurance to keep the hits flowing.<br><br>Gloves &amp; bags. Equip themed boxing gloves with unique bonuses and smash through ever tougher bag tiers.<br><br>Prestige for good reset your run to bank permanent boosts and climb a deep prestige tree.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br>Idle friendly. Flip on Auto Punch and your fighters keep earning even when you step away.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Keep Punching<br><br>Step into a cozy underground gym and do the one thing that matters Keep On Punching. Every hit fills your pockets, every upgrade lands harder, and the bag never stops swinging. It's the satisfying, one more punch idle brawler that's easy to pick up and impossible to put down. </strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Punch, earn, upgrade. Land hits, stack up coins, and pour them into Attack Power, Speed, Economy, Critical Chance, Stamina and more.<br><br>Unlock knockout techniques. Work your way up from a simple jab to hooks, a mighty Big Punch, and flashy multi-hit combos.<br><br>Crits, Perfects &amp; combos. Trigger critical strikes and Perfect Punches, then chain juicy combos for massive payouts.<br><br>Manage your stamina. Punch smart, not just hard, balance raw power against endurance to keep the hits flowing.<br><br>Gloves &amp; bags. Equip themed boxing gloves with unique bonuses and smash through ever tougher bag tiers.<br><br>Prestige for good reset your run to bank permanent boosts and climb a deep prestige tree.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br>Idle friendly. Flip on Auto Punch and your fighters keep earning even when you step away.</p>", "short_description": "Keep On Punching is a cozy idle boxing brawler. Throw punches, land crits and combos, and watch the coins pile up. Upgrade your power, unlock knockout techniques, prestige for permanent boosts, and train a roster of scrappy fighters. Just keep punching!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959840/f86c1b0346d9f3890338b8f0e5c0c92147f68471/header.jpg?t=1784537983", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959840/800931905ea605af0575f18beb7849062f368604/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784537983", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4959840/800931905ea605af0575f18beb7849062f368604/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784537983", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>